NAME          ROSENBR
* f(x,y) = 100 (y - x*x)^2 + (1 - x)^2, starting at (-1.2, 1).
* Minimal unconstrained problem for the TAO CUTEst driver tests.

VARIABLES
    X
    Y

GROUPS
 N  RESIDUAL  Y         1.0
 N  RESIDUAL  'SCALE'   0.01
 N  LINEAR    X         1.0

CONSTANTS
    ROSENBR   LINEAR    1.0

BOUNDS
 FR ROSENBR   'DEFAULT'

START POINT
    ROSENBR   X         -1.2
    ROSENBR   Y          1.0

ELEMENT TYPE
 EV SQUARE    U

ELEMENT USES
 T  XSQUARED  SQUARE
 V  XSQUARED  U                        X

GROUP TYPE
 GV SQUARE    T

GROUP USES
 T  'DEFAULT' SQUARE
 XE RESIDUAL  XSQUARED  -1.0

ENDATA

ELEMENTS      ROSENBR
INDIVIDUALS
 T  SQUARE
 F                      U * U
 G  U                   2.0 * U
 H  U         U         2.0
ENDATA

GROUPS        ROSENBR
INDIVIDUALS
 T  SQUARE
 F                      T * T
 G                      2.0 * T
 H                      2.0
ENDATA
